<PageTitle>Data layout: DbnSuite</PageTitle>

<h1>Data layout</h1>
<p class="lead">
    The exact shape of the raw archive and of every processed file, as rules. Tools that read or write either can
    rely on what follows; anything not stated here is not promised.
</p>

<div class="note"><p>
    <strong>Version 1 of the layout.</strong> A change that breaks a rule on this page changes the version and is
    called out in the release notes. Where a rule says <em>must</em>, a file that breaks it is not a DbnSuite archive
    or export, and the tools may refuse it.
</p></div>

